@startuml
title WildSafe Eye システム構成（PoC基本設計）

package "Edge デバイス" {
  [カメラ] as CAM
  [音響センサー] as MIC
  component "推論モジュール" as INFER
  component "イベント判定" as EVENT
  component "ヒステリシス制御" as HYS
  component "アラート制御" as ALERT
  database "ローカルログ" as LOG
  node "保守用sshd" as SSHD

  [低周波音発生デバイス] as SOUND
  [発光デバイス] as LIGHT
}

package "外部" {
  [通知(Email)] as EMAIL
}

CAM --> INFER
MIC --> INFER
INFER --> EVENT
EVENT --> HYS
HYS --> ALERT
ALERT --> SOUND
ALERT --> LIGHT
ALERT --> EMAIL
EVENT --> LOG

SSHD ..> LOG : ローカルログ参照
note right of SSHD
保守・デバッグ用:
- 鍵認証のみ
- ポート制限
end note
@enduml